msgid "You can use the [`plot_error_map`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.visualization.plot_error_map) function to generate a diagram of the device graph with error information and with the physical qubits labeled. You can also view similar diagrams on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page.\n"
